<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Operation Slam Gray, 1957</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;The Dominican Republic was ruled for many years by a brutal dictator,&amp;nbsp;General Rafael Trujillo.&amp;nbsp; In history, Trujillo was&amp;nbsp;assassinated in 1960.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that the assassination took place in&amp;nbsp;1957, and that in the chaos that followed a pro-Soviet government came&amp;nbsp;to power in the Dominican Republic.&amp;nbsp; The new government was immediately&amp;nbsp;recognized by the Soviet Union, and&amp;nbsp;rapidly given significant military aid.&amp;nbsp; The American President considers this an intolerable situation.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
